{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2011,"convocatoria":"Reserva 1","documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Una ventana normanda consiste en un rectángulo coronado con un semicírculo. De entre todas las ventanas normandas de perímetro 10 m, halla las dimensiones del marco de la de área máxima.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Sean \\(2r\\) el ancho del rectángulo (y \\(r\\) el radio del semicírculo) y \\(h\\) su altura:</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 200 190' width='100%' style='max-width:200px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='12' fill='currentColor'><path d='M40 170V90A60 60 0 0 1 160 90V170Z' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='40' y1='90' x2='160' y2='90' stroke='#64748b' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='100' y1='90' x2='145' y2='51' stroke='#64748b'/><text x='92' y='186' font-style='italic'>2r</text><text x='166' y='134' font-style='italic'>h</text><text x='124' y='66' font-style='italic'>r</text></svg></div><p>El perímetro (base, dos lados y la semicircunferencia) es \\(2r+2h+\\pi r=10\\Rightarrow h=\\dfrac{10-(2+\\pi)r}2\\).</p><p><b>Función a maximizar:</b> el área.</p>\\[A(r)=2rh+\\frac{\\pi r^2}2=r\\bigl(10-(2+\\pi)r\\bigr)+\\frac{\\pi r^2}2=10r-\\left(2+\\frac\\pi2\\right)r^2,\\qquad r\\in\\left(0,\\tfrac{10}{2+\\pi}\\right)\\]<p>Es polinómica<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[A'(r)=10-(4+\\pi)r=0\\iff\\boxed{r=\\frac{10}{4+\\pi}\\approx1{,}40}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1,40</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1,94</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(A\\) crece en \\(\\left(0,\\frac{10}{4+\\pi}\\right)\\) debido a que \\(A'(r)\\gt0\\), y decrece después debido a que \\(A'(r)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. El máximo está en \\(r=\\frac{10}{4+\\pi}\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>:</p>\\[h=\\frac{10-(2+\\pi)\\frac{10}{4+\\pi}}2=\\frac{10(4+\\pi)-10(2+\\pi)}{2(4+\\pi)}=\\frac{10}{4+\\pi}\\]<div class='res'>Rectángulo de ancho \\(\\dfrac{20}{4+\\pi}\\approx2{,}80\\) m y alto \\(\\dfrac{10}{4+\\pi}\\approx1{,}40\\) m, coronado por un semicírculo de radio \\(\\dfrac{10}{4+\\pi}\\) m</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula el valor de \\(b\\gt0\\), sabiendo que el área de la región comprendida entre la curva \\(y=\\sqrt x\\) y la recta \\(y=bx\\) es de \\(\\frac43\\) unidades cuadradas.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Cortes:</b> \\(\\sqrt x=bx\\Rightarrow x=b^2x^2\\iff x(b^2x-1)=0\\iff x=0\\) o \\(x=\\frac1{b^2}\\). Entre ellos la curva queda por encima. En el dibujo, el caso \\(b=\\frac12\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='40.0,141.3 45.0,126.6 50.0,120.5 55.0,115.8 60.0,111.8 65.0,108.3 70.0,105.2 75.0,102.3 80.0,99.6 85.0,97.1 90.0,94.7 95.0,92.4 100.0,90.2 105.0,88.1 110.0,86.1 115.0,84.2 120.0,82.3 125.0,80.5 130.0,78.7 135.0,77.0 140.0,75.3 145.0,73.7 150.0,72.1 155.0,70.6 160.0,69.0 165.0,67.5 170.0,66.1 175.0,64.7 180.0,63.2 185.0,61.9 190.0,60.5 195.0,59.2 200.0,57.9 205.0,56.6 210.0,55.3 215.0,54.0 220.0,52.8 225.0,51.6 230.0,50.4 235.0,49.2 240.0,48.0 240.0,48.0 235.0,50.3 230.0,52.7 225.0,55.0 220.0,57.3 215.0,59.7 210.0,62.0 205.0,64.3 200.0,66.7 195.0,69.0 190.0,71.3 185.0,73.7 180.0,76.0 175.0,78.3 170.0,80.7 165.0,83.0 160.0,85.3 155.0,87.7 150.0,90.0 145.0,92.3 140.0,94.7 135.0,97.0 130.0,99.3 125.0,101.7 120.0,104.0 115.0,106.3 110.0,108.7 105.0,111.0 100.0,113.3 95.0,115.7 90.0,118.0 85.0,120.3 80.0,122.7 75.0,125.0 70.0,127.3 65.0,129.7 60.0,132.0 55.0,134.3 50.0,136.7 45.0,139.0 40.0,141.3' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='40.0,141.3 43.0,129.9 46.0,125.2 49.0,121.5 52.0,118.5 55.0,115.8 58.0,113.3 61.0,111.1 64.0,109.0 67.0,107.0 70.0,105.2 73.0,103.4 76.0,101.7 79.0,100.1 82.0,98.6 85.0,97.1 88.0,95.6 91.0,94.2 94.0,92.8 97.0,91.5 100.0,90.2 103.0,89.0 106.0,87.7 109.0,86.5 112.0,85.3 115.0,84.2 118.0,83.0 121.0,81.9 124.0,80.8 127.0,79.8 130.0,78.7 133.0,77.7 136.0,76.7 139.0,75.7 142.0,74.7 145.0,73.7 148.0,72.7 151.0,71.8 154.0,70.9 157.0,69.9 160.0,69.0 163.0,68.1 166.0,67.3 169.0,66.4 172.0,65.5 175.0,64.7 178.0,63.8 181.0,63.0 184.0,62.1 187.0,61.3 190.0,60.5 193.0,59.7 196.0,58.9 199.0,58.1 202.0,57.3 205.0,56.6 208.0,55.8 211.0,55.0 214.0,54.3 217.0,53.5 220.0,52.8 223.0,52.1 226.0,51.3 229.0,50.6 232.0,49.9 235.0,49.2 238.0,48.5 241.0,47.8 244.0,47.1 247.0,46.4 250.0,45.7 253.0,45.0 256.0,44.3 259.0,43.7 262.0,43.0 265.0,42.3 268.0,41.7 271.0,41.0 274.0,40.4 277.0,39.7 280.0,39.1' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,150.7 150.0,90.0 280.0,29.3' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='240.0' cy='48.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='210.0' y='40.0'>(1/b², 1/b)</text><text x='250.0' y='66.7' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>y = √x</text><text x='210.0' y='27.0' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = bx</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 141.3H294.0M40.0 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='90.0' y1='138.3' x2='90.0' y2='144.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='87.0' y='155.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='140.0' y1='138.3' x2='140.0' y2='144.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='137.0' y='155.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='190.0' y1='138.3' x2='190.0' y2='144.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='187.0' y='155.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='240.0' y1='138.3' x2='240.0' y2='144.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='237.0' y='155.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='37.0' y1='94.7' x2='43.0' y2='94.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='24.0' y='98.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='37.0' y1='48.0' x2='43.0' y2='48.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='24.0' y='52.0' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^{1/b^2}\\bigl(\\sqrt x-bx\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac23x^{3/2}-\\frac b2x^2\\Bigr]_0^{1/b^2}=\\frac2{3b^3}-\\frac1{2b^3}=\\frac1{6b^3}\\]\\[\\frac1{6b^3}=\\frac43\\iff b^3=\\frac18\\iff b=\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>\\(b=\\dfrac12\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&\\lambda&1\\\\0&-1&\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) ¿Hay algún valor de \\(\\lambda\\) para el que \\(A\\) no tiene inversa?","(1,5 p.) Para \\(\\lambda=1\\), resuelve la ecuación matricial \\(A^{-1}XA=B\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) no tiene inversa si \\(|A|=0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&\\lambda&1\\\\0&-1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\lambda^{2}+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0-1+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^2+1\\]<p>\\(\\lambda^2+1\\ge1\\gt0\\) para todo \\(\\lambda\\): nunca se anula.</p><div class='res'>No: \\(A\\) tiene inversa para cualquier \\(\\lambda\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Multiplico por \\(A\\) por la izquierda y por \\(A^{-1}\\) por la derecha<i class='n' data-t='err'>Cada factor se elimina con su inverso por su mismo lado.</i>: \\(X=ABA^{-1}\\). Con \\(\\lambda=1\\):</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0-1+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=2\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & -1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=\\frac1{2}\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & -1\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[AB=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & -1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 0\\\\-1 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=ABA^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 0\\\\-1 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\\\1 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\\\-1 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & \\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2}\\\\1 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\\\-1 & \\frac{1}{2} & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dados los puntos \\(A(1,0,0)\\), \\(B(0,0,1)\\) y \\(P(1,-1,1)\\), y la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(\\begin{cases}x-y-2=0\\\\z=0\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(2 p.) Halla los puntos de la recta \\(r\\) cuya distancia al punto \\(P\\) es de 3 unidades.","(0,5 p.) Calcula el área del triángulo \\(ABP\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(y=t\\), \\(x=2+t\\), \\(z=0\\). Un punto de \\(r\\) es \\(X(2+t,\\,t,\\,0)\\). Se pide una distancia dada, así que impongo \\(|\\overrightarrow{PX}|=3\\):</p>\\[|\\overrightarrow{PX}|^2=(1+t)^2+(t+1)^2+(-1)^2=2(t+1)^2+1=9\\iff(t+1)^2=4\\iff t=1\\ \\text{ o }\\ t=-3\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-45,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-1.6,-3.6,0.0],[3.6,1.6,0.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,1.6,0.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,-1,1],[3,1,0],\"#16a34a\",1.6,true],[\"line\",[1,-1,1],[-1,-3,0],\"#16a34a\",1.6,true],[\"pt\",[1,-1,1],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,1,0],\"X₁\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,-3,0],\"X₂\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 109' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m11r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m11r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m11r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m11r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='55.2' x2='314.0' y2='55.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='55.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='170.0' y1='18.0' x2='280.8' y2='55.2' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='170.0' y1='18.0' x2='59.2' y2='55.2' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='170.0' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='177.0' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='280.8' cy='55.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='287.8' y='49.2' font-weight='700'>X₁</text><circle cx='59.2' cy='55.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='66.2' y='49.2' font-weight='700'>X₂</text><line x1='24' y1='79' x2='35.3' y2='82.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='87.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='79' x2='35.3' y2='75.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='78.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='79' x2='24.0' y2='63.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='62.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,101)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,101)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,101)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(X_1(3,1,0)\\) y \\(X_2(-1,-3,0)\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-1,0,1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AP}=(0,-1,1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&0&1\\\\0&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,1,1)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12|(1,1,1)|=\\frac{\\sqrt3}2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}2\\approx0{,}866\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\left[\\frac1e,4\\right]\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}x-\\ln(x)+a&\\text{si }\\frac1e\\le x\\le2\\\\bx+1-\\ln(2)&\\text{si }2\\lt x\\le4\\end{cases}\\) donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano.","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Calcula los valores de \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) para que \\(f\\) sea derivable en el intervalo \\(\\left(\\frac1e,4\\right)\\).","(1,25 p.) Para \\(a=0\\) y \\(b=\\frac12\\) halla los extremos absolutos de \\(f\\) (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es derivable en su intervalo abierto. En \\(x=2\\):</p><p><b>Continuidad:</b> \\(2-\\ln2+a=2b+1-\\ln2\\iff a=2b-1\\). <b>Derivabilidad:</b> \\(f'(2^-)=1-\\frac12=\\frac12\\) y \\(f'(2^+)=b\\), así que \\(b=\\frac12\\) y \\(a=0\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=0\\), \\(b=\\dfrac12\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\left[\\frac1e,4\\right]\\): alcanza máximo y mínimo absolutos<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema de Weierstrass: una función continua en un intervalo cerrado alcanza su máximo y su mínimo absolutos.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>; \\(x=2\\) es punto «problemático»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}1-\\dfrac1x&\\text{si }\\frac1e\\lt x\\lt2\\\\\\dfrac12&\\text{si }2\\lt x\\lt4\\end{cases}\\qquad1-\\frac1x=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 302 108' width='100%' style='max-width:362px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H288' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M264 56L268 48M268 56L272 48M272 56L276 48M276 56L280 48M280 56L284 48M284 56L288 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1/e</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><path d='M262 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='262' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(½) &lt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M139.0 40L175.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 11L175.0 10L173.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1,5) &gt; 0</text><text x='199.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M213.0 40L249.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M240.0 11L249.0 10L247.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='225.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\(\\left(\\frac1e,1\\right)\\) y crece en \\((1,4)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Comparo los candidatos:</p>\\[f\\left(\\frac1e\\right)=\\frac1e+1\\approx1{,}37,\\qquad f(1)=1,\\qquad f(4)=3-\\ln2\\approx2{,}31\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 190' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='52.1,89.3 54.4,92.4 56.7,95.0 59.0,97.3 61.3,99.2 63.6,100.8 65.9,102.1 68.2,103.3 70.5,104.2 72.9,105.0 75.2,105.7 77.5,106.2 79.8,106.6 82.1,106.8 84.4,107.0 86.7,107.1 89.0,107.1 91.3,107.0 93.6,106.9 95.9,106.6 98.2,106.4 100.5,106.0 102.8,105.6 105.1,105.2 107.4,104.7 109.8,104.2 112.1,103.6 114.4,103.0 116.7,102.4 119.0,101.7 121.3,101.0 123.6,100.2 125.9,99.4 128.2,98.6 130.5,97.8 132.8,96.9 135.1,96.0 137.4,95.1 139.7,94.2 142.0,93.2 144.3,92.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='144.3,92.2 200.9,68.1 257.4,43.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='87.8' cy='107.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='67.8' y='123.1'>mín abs</text><circle cx='257.4' cy='43.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='207.4' y='37.9'>máx abs</text><circle cx='52.1' cy='89.3' r='3.5' fill='0'/><text x='52.1' y='83.3'></text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 155.5H294.0M31.3 184.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='87.8' y1='152.5' x2='87.8' y2='158.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='84.8' y='169.5' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='144.3' y1='152.5' x2='144.3' y2='158.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='141.3' y='169.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='200.9' y1='152.5' x2='200.9' y2='158.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='197.9' y='169.5' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='257.4' y1='152.5' x2='257.4' y2='158.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='254.4' y='169.5' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='28.3' y1='107.1' x2='34.3' y2='107.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.3' y='111.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='28.3' y1='58.7' x2='34.3' y2='58.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.3' y='62.7' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Mínimo absoluto en \\(x=1\\), de valor \\(1\\). Máximo absoluto en \\(x=4\\), de valor \\(3-\\ln2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"cont","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:(0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x(1-\\ln(x))\\), donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano. Determina la primitiva de \\(f\\) cuya gráfica pasa por el punto \\(P(1,1)\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\int x(1-\\ln x)\\,dx=\\int x\\,dx-\\int x\\ln x\\,dx\\]<p>La segunda por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>, con \\(u=\\ln x\\), \\(dv=x\\,dx\\):</p>\\[\\int x\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\int\\frac x2\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\frac{x^2}4\\]\\[F(x)=\\frac{x^2}2-\\frac{x^2}2\\ln x+\\frac{x^2}4+C=\\frac34x^2-\\frac{x^2}2\\ln x+C\\]<p>\\(F(1)=\\frac34+C=1\\iff C=\\frac14\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(F(x)=\\dfrac34x^2-\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x+\\dfrac14\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"pcond","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dadas las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\2&t+1&t-1\\\\-2t-1&0&t+3\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\)","apartados":["(1,75 p.) Calcula el rango de \\(A\\) según los diferentes valores de \\(t\\).","(0,75 p.) Razona para qué valores de \\(t\\) el sistema homogéneo \\(AX=0\\) tiene más de una solución."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&0\\\\2&t+1&t-1\\\\-2t-1&0&t+3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(t^{2} + 4 t + 3- 2 t^{2} + t + 1+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+2 t + 6\\bigr)\\]\\[=-t^2+3t-2=-(t-1)(t-2)\\]<p>\\(|A|=0\\iff t=1\\) o \\(t=2\\). En esos dos casos el menor de las filas 1 y 3 y las columnas 1 y 3, \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\-2t-1&t+3\\end{vmatrix}=t+3\\), vale 4 y 5 respectivamente: no es nulo y el rango es 2.</p><div class='res'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\) si \\(t\\neq1,2\\); \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) si \\(t=1\\) o \\(t=2\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Un sistema homogéneo siempre tiene la solución nula; tiene más de una si es compatible indeterminado, es decir, si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A\\lt3\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: en un sistema homogéneo \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\) siempre; es determinado si el rango es igual al número de incógnitas.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Para \\(t=1\\) y para \\(t=2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"rango","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-1-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dados el punto \\(P(1,1,-1)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) de ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}x+z=1\\\\y+z=0\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y pasa por \\(P\\).","(1,5 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta contenida en el plano de ecuación \\(y+z=0\\), que es perpendicular a \\(r\\) y pasa por \\(P\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(z=t\\), \\(x=1-t\\), \\(y=-t\\). Pasa por \\(R(1,0,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(-1,-1,1)\\). El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RP}=(0,1,-1)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&-1&1\\\\0&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(0,\\,-1,\\,-1)\\parallel(0,1,1)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(y+z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(D=0\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(y+z=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Es el segundo plano de los que definen \\(r\\); \\(P\\) también lo cumple: \\(1-1=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La recta buscada está en el plano \\(y+z=0\\) (su director es perpendicular al normal \\((0,1,1)\\)) y es perpendicular a \\(r\\) (perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\)):</p>\\[\\vec u=\\vec d\\times(0,1,1)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&-1&1\\\\0&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-2,\\,1,\\,-1)\\]<p>Pasa por \\(P(1,1,-1)\\), que está en el plano:</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":87,\"el\":44,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.7,-1.554,1.554],[1.5,-1.554,1.554],[1.5,1.954,-1.954],[-0.7,1.954,-1.954]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.5,1.954,-1.954],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[2.2,1.2,-1.2],[0.0,-1.0,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,-1.0,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[2.4,0.3,-0.3],[-0.2,1.6,-1.6],\"#c2410c\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-0.2,1.6,-1.6],\"s\",\"#c2410c\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,1,-1],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m11r1b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m11r1b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m11r1b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m11r1b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='161.8,18.0 62.3,21.6 70.6,246.0 170.1,242.4' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='74.6' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='37.2' y1='198.9' x2='131.4' y2='54.6' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='137.4' y='54.6' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='141.7' x2='146.6' y2='220.6' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='152.6' y='220.6' fill='#c2410c' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='91.0' cy='184.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='98.0' y='178.2' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.0' y2='270.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='274.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.8' y2='281.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='22.1' y='289.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='258.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='258.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=1-2\\lambda\\\\y=1+\\lambda\\\\z=-1-\\lambda\\end{cases}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"perp","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_1.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}